gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Oh! There you are!\p"
	.string "I'm PROFESSOR BIRCH, and I need\n"
	.string "to tell you something incredible!\p"
	.string "Hoenn is changing before our eyes.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "For weeks now, I've been documenting\n"
	.string "the most extraordinary phenomenon.\p"
	.string "Rare POKéMON from distant regions\n"
	.string "are migrating into Hoenn's habitats.\p"
	.string "Species I've only read about in\n"
	.string "journals are appearing on our routes!\p"
	.string "LARVITAR in the rocky hills, DRATINI\n"
	.string "in our rivers, BAGON soaring overhead!\p"
	.string "Nobody knows why they've come.\n"
	.string "The ecosystem is transforming.\p"
	.string "Wild encounters that were once\n"
	.string "predictable are now full of surprises.\p"
	.string "Trainers are discovering powerful\n"
	.string "POKéMON where they least expect them.\p"
	.string "It's the greatest migration event\n"
	.string "in recorded history!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ah, you must be {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
	.string "Your father told me you were moving\n"
	.string "to LITTLEROOT TOWN.\p"
	.string "Perfect timing! Just this morning,\n"
	.string "I discovered three extraordinary\l"
	.string "juvenile POKéMON near the town!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Are you ready to witness this\n"
	.string "transformation firsthand?\p"
	.string "Your journey will take you through\n"
	.string "a Hoenn unlike any trainer has\l"
	.string "experienced before.\p"
	.string "Every route holds mysteries.\n"
	.string "Every encounter could be legendary.\p"
	.string "Come to my lab when you're ready.\n"
	.string "Let's document this incredible\l"
	.string "phenomenon together!\p"
	.string "$"
